      "value": "God no.\nThe less VRC has to do with Oculus/Facebook, the better. I use my Quest, but do not have it linked to Facebook until all that mess gets sorted out. Considering some of the things I've seen happen in VRC, I'd like to have my credentials for that far away, thanks.",
