      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like to remind you that most of the children have clueless parents that just allow the child to use the Quest under the parent's name. Plus, VRChat doesn't have anything to do with the Facebook/Meta authentication flow, they just use the API provided by Meta. Same goes for the Steam authentication, they just use the API for Steam. \n\nSo not only is there no use in trying, it isn't even possible for VRChat in the first place.\n\n(Yes, I know this was from 2021, but just to be sure I have said what I think on it.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
